      "writtenOn": "2021-05-20T00:23:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These two variables have little sense now. Ultimately we need to determine the name of the kzip file, so we need a variable called KZIP_NAME. In the order of priority from highest to lowest it can be:\n* explicitly set as environment variable\n* set from SUPERPROJECT_SHA enviroment variable if present\n* set from BUILD_NUMBER if present\n* assigned by uudgen\nWhich is something like\n: ${KZIP_NAME:\u003d${SUPERPROJECT_SHA:-}}\n: ${KZIP_NAME:\u003d${BUILD_NUMBER:-}}\n: ${KZIP_NAME:\u003d$(uuidgen}}\n\n(and then on line 59 s/SUPERPROJECT_SHA/KZIP_NAME/)",
      "revId": "0002283e85713361f2b7eb1ac581ca4e14205db8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
